  WrittenDialogue: "It’s Kelly! Welcome back everybody!\nToday on the show we have an intense lineup of guests all with their own unique stories.\nFirst we’ll talk to a girl born with a tragic birthmark resembling a Nazi swastika... On her face!\nThen we’ll talk to the world’s most viral TV Dinner reviewer, you won’t wanna miss that.\nAnd I know we can all get a little pervy sometimes...\nBut not as much as my last guest. It’s a guy who compulsively masturbates 100 times a day.\nEvery time I look in the mirror I can’t help but feel responsible.\nYou guys are great! Stick around as we navigate these on It’s Kelly!"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
